{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792547643471,"sessionID":"ses_ea3e01b08ffe25JrGjIjfiH29d","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_ec4a8b7922864bfca317acf0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11381518","format":"markdown"},"output":"                 Human cell surface-AAV interactomes identify LRP6 as blood-brain barrier transcytosis receptor and immune cytokine IL3 as AAV9 binder - PMC                                                                   [Skip to main content](#main-content)\n\n![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/us_flag.svg)\n\nAn official website of the United States government\n\nHere's how you know\n\nHere's how you know\n\n![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/icon-dot-gov.svg)\n\n**Official websites use .gov**  \nA **.gov** website belongs to an official government organization in the United States.\n\n![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/icon-https.svg)\n\n**Secure .gov websites use HTTPS**  \nA **lock** ( Lock Locked padlock icon ) or **https://** means you've safely connected to the .gov website. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites.\n\n[![NCBI home page](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/ncbi-logos/nih-nlm-ncbi--white.svg)](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/)\n\n ![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/search.svg) Search\n\n ![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/person.svg) Log in ![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/pd-medc-pmc-cloudpmc-viewer/production/9b1d9d87/var/data/static/img/usa-icons/expand_less.svg)  ![](https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov